{"product_id":"vuzix-lx1-smart-glasses","title":"Vuzix LX1 Smart Glasses","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"elementToProof\"\u003eDesigned for field support and warehousing, Vuzix LX1 smart glasses combine rugged durability with powerful, hands-free functionality to enhance the productivity of your teams. Featuring a vibrant heads-up display, voice-activated controls, and Qualcomm® processor for device longevity, the LX1 enables workers to view pick lists, stream their view, and manage workflows without breaking stride. With a -20°C operation rating and a full-shift high capacity battery, the LX1 is built to withstand the harshest conditions.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLX1 Smart Glasses (-20℃\/-4℉ to 45℃\/113℉ rated)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e7000 mAh long-shift clip in battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeadband with easy release mounting system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable multi-battery charging station\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable baseball cap mount\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMounting guide\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOne-year manufacturer’s warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46574942421158,"sku":"516PVT001","price":2199.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/LX1Isometric2.jpg?v=1754321981","url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/products\/vuzix-lx1-smart-glasses","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}